<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:00:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>国际货币基金组织敦促澳大利亚央行准备好在物价恶化时进一步收紧货币政策</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/imf-urges-rba-to-be-ready-to-tighten-further-if-prices-worsen</link><description>国际货币基金组织表示，如果价格压力更加持续，澳大利亚货币当局应做好进一步加息的准备，同时呼吁政府兑现收紧财政政策的承诺。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/imf-urges-rba-to-be-ready-to-tighten-further-if-prices-worsen'&gt;国际货币基金组织敦促澳大利亚央行准备好在物价恶化时进一步收紧货币政策&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：IMF Urges RBA to Be Ready to Tighten Further If Prices Worsen&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/imf-urges-rba-to-be-ready-to-tighten-further-if-prices-worsen</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:10:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>据报道韩国正在考虑扩大股票稳定基金</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/south-korea-reportedly-mulls-expanding-stock-stabilization-fund</link><description>据《每日经济新闻》报道，随着当局准备在波动加剧的情况下进行干预，韩国正在考虑扩大其 10.76 万亿韩元（80 亿美元）的股市稳定基金。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/south-korea-reportedly-mulls-expanding-stock-stabilization-fund'&gt;据报道韩国正在考虑扩大股票稳定基金&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：South Korea Reportedly Mulls Expanding Stock Stabilization Fund&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/south-korea-reportedly-mulls-expanding-stock-stabilization-fund</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:22:32 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>马来西亚称如果亚航财务困境恶化可能会进行干预</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/malaysia-says-may-intervene-if-airasia-s-financial-woes-worsen</link><description>第二财政部长阿米尔·哈姆扎·阿齐赞表示，如果亚洲航空集团有限公司的财务困难恶化，马来西亚可能会考虑介入支持该公司，因为政府寻求保护国内航空连通性。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/malaysia-says-may-intervene-if-airasia-s-financial-woes-worsen'&gt;马来西亚称如果亚航财务困境恶化可能会进行干预&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Malaysia Says May Intervene If AirAsia’s Struggles Worsen&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/malaysia-says-may-intervene-if-airasia-s-financial-woes-worsen</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:22:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>波动性如何破坏套利交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/how-volatility-is-undermining-the-carry-trade-video</link><description>投资者借入日元、欧元和美元等货币的套利交易在今年早些时候带来强劲回报后变得越来越难操作。彭博社的加菲猫雷诺兹讨论了市场变化如何影响该策略的吸引力。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/how-volatility-is-undermining-the-carry-trade-video'&gt;波动性如何破坏套利交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：How Volatility is Undermining the Carry Trade&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/how-volatility-is-undermining-the-carry-trade-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:40:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Rise With Nasdaq Futures, Treasuries Fall: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>